        multiplierOne.withUnsafeBufferPointer { i0 in multiplierTwo.withUnsafeBufferPointer { i1 in
            resultOne.withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer { o0 in resultTwo.withUnsafeMutableBufferPointer { o1 in
